
# Priority: filter(0)
# Special case of no connection tracking ('notrack')

# must have 'notrack' NTP rule in zone-red-inet-filter-prerouting_raw-udp/030-ntp-server.rule at raw(-300) priority
# must have 'untracked' NTP rule in zone-red-inet-filter-prerouting-udp/030-ntp-server.rule at filter(0) priority
# must have 'notrack' NTP rule in zone-red-inet-filter-output_raw-udp/030-ntp-server.rule at raw(-300) priority
# must have 'untracked' NTP rule in zone-red-inet-filter-output-udp/030-ntp-server.rule at filter(0) priority

udp sport 123 ct state untracked counter accept comment "remote NTP server response inbound to local NTP client"
